<title>USA: Claire's Stores to buy back 1 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Claire's Stores to buy back 1 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Claire's Stores Inc said it will buy back up to one million common shares, beginning immediately.</p>
<p>The company has $60 million in cash and no debt, it said, and can buy back the stock, while still continuing expansion efforts.</p>
<p>The company said it had 47.5 million common shares outstanding at the end of its third quarter.</p>
<p>Shares were off 3/4 to 14 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
